    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "- Berdasarkan hasil EDA, distribusi variabel sleep_quality_score menunjukkan pola distribusi normal dengan konsentrasi terbesar pada nilai tengah.\n",
        "\n",
        "- Kondisi ini masih dianggap realistis untuk data sleep behavior manusia dan tidak menjadi masalah signifikan apabila model yang digunakan berupa regression model.\n",
        "\n",
        "- Namun, apabila target akan dikonversi menjadi categorical classification maka terdapat potensi class imbalance karena kategori tengah akan mendominasi dataset."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "GVTFn_sjop_u"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Normalization"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "RFOuG_uTo6FE"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Normalisasi skor kualitas tidur ke rentang 0.0 - 1.0\n",
        "df_target['normalized_score'] = df_target['sleep_quality_score'] / 10.0\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "qG5MW6tgTTba"
      },
      "execution_count": 149,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Feature Enginering"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "7K_DKc6jc0oC"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "from datetime import datetime, timedelta\n",
        "\n",
        "# A. Sintesis Tanggal (Rentang 3 bulan di 2026)\n",
        "start_date = datetime(2026, 1, 1)\n",
        "df_target['date'] = [(start_date + timedelta(days=np.random.randint(0, 90))).strftime('%Y-%m-%d') for _ in range(len(df_target))]\n",
        "\n",
        "# B. Membuat Waktu Tidur & Bangun Dinamis\n",
        "def generate_times(duration):\n",
        "    b_hour = np.random.choice([21, 22, 23, 0])\n",
        "    b_min = np.random.randint(0, 60)\n",
        "    bedtime_dt = datetime(2026, 3, 1, b_hour, b_min)\n",
        "    wake_dt = bedtime_dt + timedelta(hours=duration)\n",
        "    return bedtime_dt.strftime('%H:%M'), wake_dt.strftime('%H:%M')\n",
        "\n",
        "df_target[['bedtime', 'wake_time']] = df_target.apply(lambda x: pd.Series(generate_times(x['sleep_duration_hrs'])), axis=1)\n",
        "\n",
        "# C. Menghitung Sleep Debt (Standar 8 Jam)\n",
        "df_target['sleep_debt'] = df_target['sleep_duration_hrs'].apply(lambda x: max(0, 8 - x))"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "2PlAbP_qPZua"
      },
      "execution_count": 150,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Final Mapping"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "vQaui_PhPcK7"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "df_final = pd.DataFrame({\n",
        "    'id': [f\"slp_{i+1:04d}\" for i in range(len(df_target))],\n",
        "    'user_id': df_target['person_id'].apply(lambda x: f\"usr_{x}\"),\n",
        "    'date': df_target['date'],\n",
        "    'bedtime': df_target['bedtime'],\n",
        "    'wake_time': df_target['wake_time'],\n",
        "    'duration_hours': df_target['sleep_duration_hrs'],\n",
        "    'interruptions': df_target['wake_episodes_per_night'],\n",
        "    'sleep_debt_hours': df_target['sleep_debt'],\n",
        "    'quality_score': df_target['normalized_score']\n",
        "})"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ub-CGtq8Pevv"
      },
      "execution_count": 151,
      "outputs": []
